1 area 18        -> ready at slide from the left
2 area 0         -> ready
3 no slot 213    -> ready
4 slide, no ready-> slide
5 slide, LT up   -> ready on slide
6 slide, LT held -> slide
7 start 3, area  -> ready at slide
8 free           -> free
9 specific pose  -> ready at slide from the left  (own pose loaded for it: true)
10 left holster  -> at right hip holster
11 zone + holster-> ready at slide
12 right zone    -> free + right hand ready at slide from the left
13 right holster -> free + right hand at left shoulder holster
14 both holsters -> at left hip holster + right hand at left shoulder holster
15 per-hand load -> [hand_poser] own pose loaded: no gun @ at left hip holster | no gun @ right hand at left shoulder holster
16 no 214-216    -> free
17 guard         -> guard
18 guard, no gun -> 'any gun @ guard' used: false
19 guard pose    -> [hand_poser] own pose loaded: no gun @ guard
20 block off     -> ready at slide + right hand ready at slide
21 sway          -> free true, ready true, docked false, guard false
